  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Modernizacin Administracin Financiera Municipal</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Modernization of Municipal Financial Administration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM AIMS AT CONTRIBUTING TO THE DESCENTRALIZATION PROCESS IN BOLIVIA ACCORDING TO THE MODERNIZATION OF THE MUNICIPAL FINANCING ADMINISTRATION IN COURSE. THE PROGRAM OBJECTIVES ARE 1)TO IMPLEMENT THE SYSTEM ON MANAGEMENT AND ADMINISTRATIVE MODERNIZATION (SIGMA) IN APPROX.120 MUNICIPALITIES IN THE COUNTRY; 2) TO MATERIALIZE THE COMMUNICATION AND COORDINATION AMONG THE MUNICIPAL ADMINIST.AND THE CENTRAL ADMINIST.;3) TO STRENGTHEN THE STATE GENERAL COMPTROLLER&apos;S OFFICE.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
